      <size maxheight='827' maxwidth='1169' minheight='827' minwidth='1169' preset-index='16' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='4' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='46796' id='709' type-v2='text' w='98632' x='684' y='52237'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>Dashboard sections and associated indicators:</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>There are *X* sections in this dashboard.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#2f63a2' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>Example:</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>Households initially assessed as homeless or threatened with homelessness, Statutorily homeless households placed in temporary accommodation</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#2f63a2' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>*List dashboard section title*:</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>*List all the indicators used under this section*</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#2f63a2' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>*List dashboard section title*:</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>*List all the indicators used under this section*</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#2f63a2' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>Key Neighbourhoods:</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>Surrey Health and Well-being Key Neighbourhoods, 2019 English Indices of Multiple Deprivation</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#b4b4b4' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              <format attr='padding' value='7' />
              <format attr='background-color' value='#ffffff' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='14269' id='710' type-v2='text' w='98632' x='684' y='23579'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>Navigation instructions:</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>You can navigate to the various dashboard sections by clicking on the corresponding title on the landing page. Some sections may contain sub-section pages which will appear in the navigation banner under the section title. To return to the landing page, please click the Home icon on the top left corner.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#b4b4b4' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              <format attr='padding' value='7' />
              <format attr='background-color' value='#ffffff' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='14389' id='711' type-v2='text' w='98632' x='684' y='37848'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>Filters:</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>Various filters can be found in this dashboard to change data displays by time period, area type or indicator. Simply make your selection/s from the drop down filters and visuals will update automatically. Please note if there is no data available for your current filter selection some visualisations may not show. Please change your filter selection to remedy this.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#b4b4b4' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              <format attr='padding' value='7' />
              <format attr='background-color' value='#ffffff' />
